   emulation toolkit and is neither affiliated with, endorsed by, nor sponsored
   by Sony Group Corporation.
2. Zero proprietary Sony firmware binaries (`*.so`, `*.elf`, `*.ko`, `*.bin`),
   Linux kernel images (`vmlinuz*`, `initramfs*`), or media assets are included
   in or distributed with this repository. All runtime analysis harnesses
   reference user-extracted firmware paths externally via `A7R3_FW_ROOT`.
3. All acquisition and unpacking utilities operate strictly read-only on host
   images or stage bounded windows inside volatile camera RAM (`/tmp_bt` tmpfs).
   Use solely on hardware and legally obtained firmware backups you own.

